WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:31.833
In verse 13.13,

2
00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:33.291
Lord Krishna introduces the jneyam –

3
00:00:33.291 --> 00:00:36.250
the object of knowledge –

4
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.083
which leads a person

5
00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:40.500
to eternal joy and liberation.

6
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.333
This is the next subject of Chapter 13,

7
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:44.541
which comes after

8
00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:47.875
the explanation of the kshetra
and the kshetrajna.

9
00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:50.791
Here kshetra means the field of activity,

10
00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:52.625
and kshetrajna means

11
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:54.500
the knower of the field.

12
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.458
Lord Krishna first

13
00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:57.416
describes the individual soul –

14
00:00:57.416 --> 00:00:59.208
the jivatma –

15
00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:00.250
and then in the

16
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.500
verses that follow discusses the Paramatma.

17
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.625
Understanding both the soul and
the Paramatma

18
00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:08.625
is essential for the realisation of amrita.

19
00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:11.708
Amrita means eternal joy

20
00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:13.416
or immortality.

21
00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:22.000
Jneyam yat tat pravakshyami –

22
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.333
‘Now I will describe the jneyam’:

23
00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:26.166
Lord Krishna now

24
00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:27.500
gives His word to explain

25
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.375
the object of knowledge – the jneyam.

26
00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:31.708
By knowing it, a person

27
00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.791
attains amrita – immortality

28
00:01:33.791 --> 00:01:36.541
or eternal joy.

29
00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:38.666
This knowledge is far above the

30
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:41.291
ordinary information of the material world.

31
00:01:41.291 --> 00:01:43.791
This knowledge is centred on the
soul, the Paramatma,

32
00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:45.458
and ultimately

33
00:01:45.458 --> 00:01:47.666
on understanding the Supreme Lord.

34
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:49.416
Material knowledge is centred

35
00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:51.541
on the interaction of the twenty-four elements

36
00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:53.208
described earlier.

37
00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:56.458
But understanding the knower of
the body – the soul –

38
00:01:56.458 --> 00:01:58.250
and the Paramatma

39
00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:02.083
takes a person beyond material bondage.

40
00:02:02.083 --> 00:02:04.416
Lord Krishna emphasises

41
00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:05.625
that knowledge of the soul

42
00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:06.833
frees a person

43
00:02:06.833 --> 00:02:08.833
from birth and death.

44
00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:10.375
Through this the soul

45
00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:14.666
can experience its original blissful nature.

46
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:18.708
Yaj jnatva amritam ashnute –

47
00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:19.958
‘By knowing this, one

48
00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:22.458
tastes the eternal’:

49
00:02:22.458 --> 00:02:24.333
By understanding the soul

50
00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:25.666
and its relationship

51
00:02:25.666 --> 00:02:26.541
with the Lord,

52
00:02:26.541 --> 00:02:29.750
a person attains liberation and eternal joy.

53
00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.458
Here amrita means

54
00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:33.500
tasting the nectar of immortality

55
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.333
by understanding the eternal soul.

56
00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:38.000
Liberation –

57
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.250
moksha – is not merely

58
00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.125
freedom from birth and death,

59
00:02:41.125 --> 00:02:43.208
but attaining the joy

60
00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:46.250
of the Lord’s eternal service.

61
00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.875
Knowing the Lord as the ultimate shelter –

62
00:02:48.875 --> 00:02:50.875
mat-param –

63
00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:52.750
leads toward liberation.

64
00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.041
In its highest form

65
00:02:54.041 --> 00:02:56.416
this merges into devotion,

66
00:02:56.416 --> 00:02:59.583
where the soul experiences eternal love

67
00:02:59.583 --> 00:03:03.000
and bliss.

68
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.041
Anadi mat-param Brahma –

69
00:03:05.041 --> 00:03:08.875
‘The soul is beginningless and
under My shelter’:

70
00:03:08.875 --> 00:03:10.250
The soul is anadi –

71
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.583
it has no beginning.

72
00:03:12.583 --> 00:03:15.666
This means it was never created

73
00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:17.208
and has always existed as

74
00:03:17.208 --> 00:03:20.916
an eternal spark of consciousness.

75
00:03:20.916 --> 00:03:24.000
This eternal nature of the soul is confirmed

76
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:27.416
also in the Katha Upanishad.

77
00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:30.500
‘Na jayate mriyate va vipashchit’ –

78
00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.958
‘The soul

79
00:03:31.958 --> 00:03:35.541
is neither born nor does it die.’

80
00:03:35.541 --> 00:03:37.750
Mat-param means that the soul

81
00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.708
is under Lord Krishna’s shelter.

82
00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:43.125
Although the soul has the qualities
of sat – eternity,

83
00:03:43.125 --> 00:03:46.625
chit – knowledge, and ananda – bliss,

84
00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:48.000
it is still only a small

85
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.375
particle of spiritual consciousness.

86
00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:53.708
It depends for its existence and nourishment

87
00:03:53.708 --> 00:03:56.000
on the Supreme Lord alone.

88
00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:59.291
The constitutional position of the
soul is as the eternal

89
00:03:59.291 --> 00:04:00.875
servant of the Lord.

90
00:04:00.875 --> 00:04:03.250
However much the jiva may try to

91
00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.375
become independent of the Lord,

92
00:04:05.375 --> 00:04:10.291
its ultimate identity remains as a
servant of Lord Krishna.

93
00:04:10.291 --> 00:04:13.666
Na sat tan na asad uchyate –

94
00:04:13.666 --> 00:04:16.458
‘It is beyond cause and effect’:

95
00:04:16.458 --> 00:04:17.375
The soul is beyond

96
00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:18.833
cause and effect – sat

97
00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:21.583
and asat – beyond their duality.

98
00:04:21.583 --> 00:04:24.000
Sat – cause – refers to the

99
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.083
unmanifest state

100
00:04:25.083 --> 00:04:27.333
before creation.

101
00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:30.541
Asat – effect – refers to the manifest

102
00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:33.791
material reality after creation.

103
00:04:33.791 --> 00:04:36.625
Since the soul is eternal and not subject

104
00:04:36.625 --> 00:04:38.625
to creation or destruction,

105
00:04:38.625 --> 00:04:41.416
it is beyond these dualities.

106
00:04:41.416 --> 00:04:42.708
While the body

107
00:04:42.708 --> 00:04:46.083
undergoes birth, growth, and decay,

108
00:04:46.083 --> 00:04:49.333
the soul remains unchanged.

109
00:04:49.333 --> 00:04:51.375
The soul is like a person

110
00:04:51.375 --> 00:04:53.083
watching a film.

111
00:04:53.083 --> 00:04:54.583
The events of the film –

112
00:04:54.583 --> 00:04:58.000
birth, death, joy, and sorrow –

113
00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:01.041
happen on the screen, but the viewer

114
00:05:01.041 --> 00:05:02.791
remains unaffected.

115
00:05:02.791 --> 00:05:04.250
In the same way, the soul

116
00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:06.916
witnesses the changes of the body,

117
00:05:06.916 --> 00:05:10.583
but does not itself undergo any transformation.

118
00:05:10.583 --> 00:05:14.333
Lord Krishna clarifies that
when the word Brahma

119
00:05:14.333 --> 00:05:16.500
is used in reference to the soul,

120
00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.000
it means

121
00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:23.000
vijnana Brahma – the conscious, individual soul.

122
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.458
Vijnana Brahma

123
00:05:24.458 --> 00:05:26.916
refers to the jivatma –

124
00:05:26.916 --> 00:05:28.291
individual consciousness,

125
00:05:28.291 --> 00:05:32.208
endowed with limited knowledge
and awareness.

126
00:05:32.208 --> 00:05:33.458
Ananda Brahma

127
00:05:33.458 --> 00:05:36.875
refers to the Supreme Brahma, Lord Krishna –

128
00:05:36.875 --> 00:05:40.666
who is the source of unlimited
bliss and knowledge.

129
00:05:40.666 --> 00:05:44.250
The jivatma, being vijnana Brahma, is the eternal

130
00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.291
servant of ananda Brahma.

131
00:05:46.291 --> 00:05:49.500
Its fulfilment lies in understanding
this relationship

132
00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:53.166
and engaging in pure devotional service.

133
00:05:53.166 --> 00:05:54.625
Lord Krishna begins

134
00:05:54.625 --> 00:05:56.583
by explaining the soul – the jivatma –

135
00:05:56.583 --> 00:05:58.250
to understand,

136
00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.958
because understanding one’s true

137
00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:01.458
spiritual identity

138
00:06:01.458 --> 00:06:04.291
is the first step toward liberation.

139
00:06:04.291 --> 00:06:05.750
Without this knowledge,

140
00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:09.250
a person remains trapped in the
illusion that they

141
00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:10.958
are only the body.

142
00:06:10.958 --> 00:06:11.833
Because of this,

143
00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:13.041
in the cycle of birth

144
00:06:13.041 --> 00:06:15.916
and death they continue to suffer.

145
00:06:15.916 --> 00:06:17.833
Recognising oneself as Brahma –

146
00:06:17.833 --> 00:06:19.875
the soul –

147
00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:22.041
gives a vast perspective.

148
00:06:22.041 --> 00:06:23.916
Through this a person becomes aware

149
00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:27.041
of their eternal relationship with the Lord.

150
00:06:27.041 --> 00:06:29.916
In this verse, Lord Krishna, for
the verses that follow,

151
00:06:29.916 --> 00:06:31.791
prepares the foundation for

152
00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.791
the explanation of the Paramatma.

153
00:06:33.791 --> 00:06:36.666
By knowing the soul and the
Paramatma, a person

154
00:06:36.666 --> 00:06:37.875
not only gains freedom

155
00:06:37.875 --> 00:06:40.250
from the cycle of birth and death,

156
00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.291
but also attains amrita –

157
00:06:42.291 --> 00:06:45.166
eternal joy.

158
00:06:45.166 --> 00:06:47.625
The nature of the soul is eternal,

159
00:06:47.625 --> 00:06:50.416
and it remains dependent on the Lord.

160
00:06:50.416 --> 00:06:53.375
This fact underlines

161
00:06:53.375 --> 00:06:57.041
that true knowledge finds its
fulfilment in the realisation

162
00:06:57.041 --> 00:06:58.916
of eternal service to Lord Krishna,

163
00:06:58.916 --> 00:07:01.750
who is the source of all existence.

164
00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.000
Notice this –

165
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:12.500
you spend most of your life protecting yourself.

166
00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:13.791
You worry about the future,

167
00:07:13.791 --> 00:07:15.541
you fear loss,

168
00:07:15.541 --> 00:07:17.625
you chase achievements,

169
00:07:17.625 --> 00:07:21.166
and you try to hold on to things

170
00:07:21.166 --> 00:07:23.333
that keep constantly changing.

171
00:07:23.333 --> 00:07:27.416
But have you ever stopped and asked –

172
00:07:27.416 --> 00:07:32.125
who am I really?

173
00:07:32.125 --> 00:07:36.416
You are not this body that grows old.

174
00:07:36.416 --> 00:07:40.541
Nor are you this mind that keeps changing.

175
00:07:40.541 --> 00:07:42.375
You are the soul.

176
00:07:42.375 --> 00:07:45.250
You are eternal, unchanging,

177
00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:48.250
and untouched by birth or death.

178
00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:51.708
When you truly understand this,

179
00:07:51.708 --> 00:07:56.625
your relationship with life changes.

180
00:07:56.625 --> 00:07:59.083
You no longer live in the fear

181
00:07:59.083 --> 00:08:02.291
that something might go wrong.

182
00:08:02.291 --> 00:08:05.166
You stop tying your happiness

183
00:08:05.166 --> 00:08:08.708
to every rise and fall.

184
00:08:08.708 --> 00:08:10.166
Real peace

185
00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:14.333
does not come from controlling everything,

186
00:08:14.333 --> 00:08:19.625
but from knowing that you are beyond all of this.

187
00:08:19.625 --> 00:08:21.500
And real joy

188
00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:25.958
does not come from adding more
things to your life.

189
00:08:25.958 --> 00:08:30.166
It comes from remembering

190
00:08:30.166 --> 00:08:34.375
who you truly are.

191
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:38.666
The moment you begin to live not just

192
00:08:38.666 --> 00:08:43.625
as a body but as a soul,

193
00:08:43.625 --> 00:08:50.500
you begin to feel lighter, freer,
and more content,

194
00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:50.958
because

195
00:08:50.958 --> 00:08:54.000
now you are not merely surviving.

196
00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.166
You are living with a purpose, with clarity,

197
00:08:58.166 --> 00:09:01.625
and deeply connected to something

198
00:09:01.625 --> 00:09:05.041
eternally meaningful.

199
00:09:05.041 --> 00:09:06.791
Living this way

200
00:09:06.791 --> 00:09:09.625
changes everything.

201
00:09:14.291 --> 00:09:16.125
Think about this –

202
00:09:16.125 --> 00:09:19.500
do you not all

203
00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:22.375
want a long, happy life for your loved ones?

204
00:09:22.375 --> 00:09:25.291
Look – deep down,

205
00:09:25.291 --> 00:09:28.083
what you truly

206
00:09:28.083 --> 00:09:31.416
want is for them to experience

207
00:09:31.416 --> 00:09:36.166
something lasting and eternal.

208
00:09:36.166 --> 00:09:37.791
But how

209
00:09:37.791 --> 00:09:42.125
can this really be given?

210
00:09:42.125 --> 00:09:43.750
Not only by caring for their comfort

211
00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:46.916
or health,

212
00:09:46.916 --> 00:09:53.125
but by giving them something far greater.

213
00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:55.083
Spiritual knowledge.

214
00:09:55.083 --> 00:09:58.708
When your family begins to understand

215
00:09:58.708 --> 00:10:01.208
that they are not merely bodies

216
00:10:01.208 --> 00:10:03.875
but eternal souls,

217
00:10:03.875 --> 00:10:05.750
their entire outlook on

218
00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.875
life changes.

219
00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:10.500
They stop being disturbed by every

220
00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.250
small success or failure.

221
00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.041
They begin to live

222
00:10:14.041 --> 00:10:16.750
with peace, clarity, and

223
00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:21.791
a sense of deep purpose.

224
00:10:21.791 --> 00:10:23.500
This does not mean

225
00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:27.000
that they stop enjoying life.

226
00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:30.875
It means that for happiness they stop

227
00:10:30.875 --> 00:10:34.041
depending on material pleasures.

228
00:10:34.041 --> 00:10:34.958
They begin to taste

229
00:10:34.958 --> 00:10:39.666
life’s true amrita,

230
00:10:39.666 --> 00:10:41.583
not through indulgence,

231
00:10:41.583 --> 00:10:45.208
but through spiritual awakening.

232
00:10:45.208 --> 00:10:46.666
That is why –

233
00:10:46.666 --> 00:10:50.500
speak about the soul at home.

234
00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.458
Share the Gita.

235
00:10:52.458 --> 00:10:55.875
Reflect together.

236
00:10:55.875 --> 00:10:59.208
When your family remembers

237
00:10:59.208 --> 00:11:04.250
who they truly are, then know

238
00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:08.458
that you have not only extended their lives,

239
00:11:08.458 --> 00:11:12.958
but also enriched them.

240
00:11:12.958 --> 00:11:15.791
You have helped them

241
00:11:15.791 --> 00:11:20.083
experience eternity within this very lifetime.

242
00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.416
To succeed in professional life,

243
00:11:27.416 --> 00:11:29.750
what do you do?

244
00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.291
You work hard.

245
00:11:31.291 --> 00:11:33.041
You meet deadlines,

246
00:11:33.041 --> 00:11:34.375
attend meetings,

247
00:11:34.375 --> 00:11:35.916
chase promotions,

248
00:11:35.916 --> 00:11:38.166
aim for the next big salary.

249
00:11:38.166 --> 00:11:42.000
But pause for a moment and ask –

250
00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.125
is this all there is?

251
00:11:45.125 --> 00:11:46.583
What if

252
00:11:46.583 --> 00:11:50.833
there were a way to work more deeply?

253
00:11:50.833 --> 00:11:53.333
Not only for success,

254
00:11:53.333 --> 00:11:56.208
but for true satisfaction.

255
00:11:56.208 --> 00:12:00.916
I will tell you – it begins

256
00:12:00.916 --> 00:12:03.333
when you remember.

257
00:12:03.333 --> 00:12:06.125
You are not merely an employee

258
00:12:06.125 --> 00:12:09.166
or a designation.

259
00:12:09.166 --> 00:12:11.916
You are a soul.

260
00:12:11.916 --> 00:12:15.041
When you work from a place

261
00:12:15.041 --> 00:12:18.750
where your soul is deeply connected,

262
00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:22.458
work becomes more meaningful.

263
00:12:22.458 --> 00:12:23.583
You no longer need

264
00:12:23.583 --> 00:12:26.125
external praise to feel

265
00:12:26.125 --> 00:12:29.000
your own worth.

266
00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:32.666
You stop fearing failure

267
00:12:32.666 --> 00:12:35.375
as if it were the end of everything.

268
00:12:35.375 --> 00:12:39.625
Instead, you begin to ask –

269
00:12:39.625 --> 00:12:42.708
‘How can I serve better?

270
00:12:42.708 --> 00:12:45.875
How can I grow through this?’

271
00:12:45.875 --> 00:12:47.208
Your work

272
00:12:47.208 --> 00:12:50.541
becomes an important part
of your inner growth,

273
00:12:50.541 --> 00:12:53.625
not merely of your outer progress.

274
00:12:53.625 --> 00:12:57.625
The real reward is not only the salary.

275
00:12:57.625 --> 00:13:01.791
It is the peace that comes

276
00:13:01.791 --> 00:13:04.583
when you align your efforts

277
00:13:04.583 --> 00:13:08.541
with your higher self.

278
00:13:08.541 --> 00:13:12.458
A promotion may come or may not come,

279
00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:15.458
but when you work with purpose,

280
00:13:15.458 --> 00:13:16.833
with honesty,

281
00:13:16.833 --> 00:13:21.375
and with spiritual awareness,

282
00:13:21.375 --> 00:13:25.000
you rise in ways that

283
00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:29.708
no ladder can ever reach.

284
